# Nigutu configuration template
#
# Nigutu needs no API keys to build or run:
#  * Local playback uses Android MediaStore and needs only runtime audio permission.
#  * Online discovery uses the public Deezer API (no key, 30s preview streams).
#  * Lyrics use the public LRCLIB API (no key).
#
# If you add a provider that does require credentials, keep them out of source
# control. Put them in your local `local.properties` or a `.env` file, read them
# through BuildConfig fields, and never commit real values.
#
# NIGUTU_EXTRA_PROVIDER_KEY=
